Package: dastash
Title: A Persistent Disk Cache Shared Between Processes
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Pedro", "Baltazar", , "pedrobtz@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"))
Description: A persistent, size-bounded cache that several R processes on
    one machine can share, in the style of the Python 'diskcache' library.
    Keys map to values that outlive the session, expire on a clock, carry
    tags for bulk invalidation, and are culled when the cache grows past a
    limit. Metadata and small values live in a transactional 'libmdbx'
    database through the 'mdbx' package; larger values are stored as
    content-addressed files.
